# Landfall - "Whenever a land you control enters" (CR 603.2): each land is its own trigger. On turn 5 Bot1 plays a Forest and casts
# the Nursery for {5}{G}{G} (one Forest: seven mana from seven Mox Emeralds, nothing floating). Bot2's Island entering on turn 6
# makes no token (the control for "you control": the Island is a land, and the Nursery is in play). On turn 7 Bot1 plays Wooded
# Foothills (a Treefolk) and cracks it to fetch a Forest (a second Treefolk): two Treefolk, both 3/4 green with reach.

